list:
Human, let me add my praises
To the thanks of our Dread Monarch.
You have joined the hallowed canon
Of the heroes of our nation.
With the stubborn dedication
Of our brother Incey-Wincey;
With the curds and whey that scattered

From the tuffet of Miss Muffet;
With the weaving of Arachne;

With the cunning of Anansi;
With these and our other stories
Your time here will be remembered.

I feed upon the sword, spade and rake;
I pierce the armour that none can break;
One drop and I can stop a watch's flow;
But without time I cannot grow.
What am I?
